<title>USA: Walden buys three properties.</title>
<headline>Walden buys three properties.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996--Walden Residential Properties Inc said it had acquired three apartment properties in Florida and Tennessee for a total price of about $23.5 million.</p>
<p>Planned renovation costs for the three properties are estimated to be $1.4 million.</p>
<p>The company also completed the sale of its Christiwood Apartments in Corpus Christi, Texas. The 304-unit property, constructed in 1984, was sold for $9.2 million.</p>
<p>The properties acquired comprise apartments in Jacksonville and Melbourne, Fla., and Nashville, Tenn. The have a total of 736 apartment units.</p>
<p>-- New York newsroom, (212) 859-1610</p>
